WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Two numbers appear close together in a fast-moving stream. Sometimes the second never reaches the report.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
The 1992 experiment found a brief decline after people identified the first target.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.000
The eyes were open. The target was on the screen. Attention still had a limit.

4
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:27.000
A 2007 study found a smaller blink after months of intensive meditation training.

5
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
That study did not test Zen12 or any commercial twelve-minute brainwave recording.

6
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Study the evidence. Test your own preferences. Keep the buying decision separate.
